、この芽は彼の体から芽生え、激痛を引き起こす。\n\n彼に合うものは何でもやらせてもらうが、できればアートはもっと不吉な、あるいは怖い方面にしてほしい！\n\nあなたが望むなら、彼の能力を使って描いてもいい。\n\n全身を描くことが可能であれば、自由に描いてください！そうでなければ、体の3/4くらいまでなら大丈夫です。\n\nキャンバスの大きさはお任せしますが、できれば横長の絵を希望します。\n\n参考URLは自動的にリンクされるはずですが、こちらで原画などを確認できます！\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/33439919_e8oBZUiE9egkvT9.png\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/102025841_2GUWt73P7NFvh07.png\n\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/33439919_e8oBZUiE9egkvT9.png", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 10179, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "倉吉サム🐢お仕事募集中", "screen_name": "kurakichi36", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1827640346358026240/lduGKRYQ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2678918342/1724578390/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 80, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 16}, {"id": 948093, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "にく🔞『融国』創作", "screen_name": "niku_vacuum", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1758297781025034240/I1yyoUrR.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/899666540919873536/1708937870/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 2765785, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "𝗙𝗶𝗡𝗲", "screen_name": "fine_9725", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_